  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For given hyperbola the eccentricity is given as<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><msup><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Length of latus rectum <math><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />On differentiating w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math><mi>l</mi></math> is an increasing function<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> Range of latus rectum is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
